     "text": "{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"From phishing:initialAccess the attacker reaches only iotDevice:exploitPublicApp, mailClient:execution and tokenCache:credentialAccess. Every path onward is blocked. workstation:execution needs wifiGuest or supplychain, so apiToken, browserStore, dbLogin and ssoLogin cannot be reached. rdpLogin needs memoryDump, which needs ciRunner (via vpnGateway) or supplychain. vpnSession needs dmzWeb, which needs vpnGateway or wifiGuest. With no route to printServer, backupHost, jumpHost, secretsManager or serviceAccount, none of the four collection parents of crownData:exfiltrate are reachable.\"}"
